    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d649">

                <pb facs="0886" n="790" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg790"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum from French embassy.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Could the Department of State inform the French ambassador whether the Spanish
                    schooner <hi rendition="#italic">Sofia</hi> is among the number of vessels
                    captured by the Federal fleet?</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-04-29"><hi rendition="#italic">April 29,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
